{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e2d825ea-58b8-8e64-b65a-9a3667a48909",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T14:04:00-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Linda Hazard",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:02:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:02:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good afternoon. I'm calling about Christmas trees. When they get picked up, I mean, I manage a house and the tenants are asking..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:02:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. Is it a house that gets regular city trash pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:02:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it does. The regular trash and recycling, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:02:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And what's the location, so I can check the right area?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:02:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 125 Carroll Avenue. In the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:02:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "125 Carroll Avenue, got it. Bear with me one second while I pull up the schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:02:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Oh, and I know I talk quickly, I'm happy to speak slower if that helps you, just say so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:02:56-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're fine, Linda, I'm catching everything. Okay, so for Carroll Avenue, trees are collected curbside in January, and I'd say put it out the night before your regular trash day. Tree has to be bare, no lights, no tinsel, no bags."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:03:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No bags, no lights. Okay. Is there a fee for that? Or a sticker, or..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:03:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No fee, it's part of regular service. Just set it at the curb, not in the street, and keep it clear of the bins."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:03:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So at the curb, away from the bins, bare tree, night before. And it goes on the regular day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:03:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly. If it's a very big tree, cutting it in half is a good idea."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:03:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll tell them that. And it's still the same day as the regular trash, just so I have it straight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:03:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same day as your regular pickup, yes. If it's still sitting there a few days after that, give us a call back and we'll look into it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:03:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. That's all I needed. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:03:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Happy New Year to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:03:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, bye now."
    }
  ],
